                <p>Depends on why it's moving, not on how alarming it looks. Some situations call for acting now; a lot of them call for documenting and watching first.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="myth-card" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Tap to flip for the answer">
